<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, "Times New Roman", serif;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 50px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #f5f5f5;
        padding: 20px;
        border-top-left-radius: 10px;
        border-top-right-radius: 10px;
      }
      .header img {
        width: 120px;
        height: auto;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 19px;
        color: #333;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #555;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .email {
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .verify-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #4f46e5;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 25px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .verify-button:hover {
        background-color: #4338ca;
      }
      .link {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #666;
        margin-top: 15px;
      }
      .footer {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .title {
        width: 600px;
        /* background-color: red; */
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #0c5197;
      }
      span {
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .footer img {
        height: 140px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <img
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dn3mokfxz/image/upload/v1738158124/sdPRL1D138_omge9h.gif"
          alt="Email Verification"
        />
      </div>
      <h1>Your Mbaay Vendor Account has been Verified ✅</h1>
      <div class="title"><h3>Dear <%= storeName %></h3></div>
      <p>
        Congratulations! Your vendor account on Mbaay has been successfully
        verified. You can now log in and start exploring all the exciting
        features designed to help you showcase and sell your unique products to
        a global audience.
      </p>
      <div class="title"><h3>What’s Next?</h3></div>
      <div class="title">
        <p>
          ✅ <span>Log in to Your Account</span>: Access your dashboard and
          manage your store effortlessly.
        </p>
        <p>
          ✅ <span>List Your Products</span>: Start uploading and showcasing
          your cultural treasures.
        </p>
        <p>
          ✅ <span>Connect with Buyers</span>: Engage with customers and grow
          your business.
        </p>
        <p>
          ✅ <span>Enjoy Seamless Transactions</span>: Experience smooth and
          secure order processing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <h3>
        <a href="https://www.mbaay.com/login-vendor"
          >🔗 Login to Your Vendor Dashboard</a
        >
      </h3>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to
        our support team.
      </p>
      <h3>Welcome to Mbaay! 🚀</h3>
      <p>
        Best regards, <br />
        <span>The Mbaay Team</span>
      </p>
      <p class="footer">
        <img
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dn3mokfxz/image/upload/v1737988620/new_mbaay-removebg-preview_cyimbt.png"
          alt=""
        />
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
